==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 23.33~30 seconds<sup>700f~900f</sup>.
*5 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*10 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Teacher Bear]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*2 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 46.67~53.33 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

